    "<end of gospel reading>"

    "A quiet silence fills the church as the father leaves the podium and returns to the altar, his robes filling the air in silence as the father of the church stands there and begins a sermon that is expected of many Christian masses. A Catholic one serves the same as he begins to walk down the isle."

    "“Today’s readings warn us of the dangers of gluttony as it blinds us from the goal of heaven, our ultimate goal in our life.”"

    Yul "(Mhm. Sounds about right for the reading…)"

    "Life will tempt us with many, many things in life. Some of us may even be blessed by many goods in our lives."

    Yul "(Yea yea, sounds about right too… some of us better off than others… today feels normal but different. The big day is approaching and I should be ready for it…)"

    "“But we must remind ourselves that not everyone is as fortunate as we are in this world, and living in excess can never satiate the hunger our soul has.”"

    Yul "(Yea, nothing can satiate my soul… should seek out greater callings… to do more good for the world and share my wealth, yea yea…)"

    "“Mmmmp mhmmm mhummm hmmm, m-memur mur”"

    Yul "(Yea, sounds about right… sounds right, feed… the poor… the hungry… hungry…)"

    Yul "(What is the world even about when consumption of others exist… what would happen if Jesus was-)"

    "Gurgle"

    "A particularly loud groan from a stomach faintly echoes throughout the quiet halls of the church as the father pauses for a moment and begins to use the opportunity to enhance his sermon. The notable sound of a large, gurgling stomach tainting the pure air momentarily before being snuffed out once more through Catholic ideals and obedience once more among all churchgoers… "

    Yul "(Wait… did someone just eat someone and go to church hungry or…)"

    "A young woman in a yellow shirt and blue shorts sits on a pew, restless as she sits on a pew in a lazy manner, almost inappropriately. Her head resting off the top of the all-wood pew as she quietly tries to get comfortable in her seat while letting her imagination go wild. Her eyes glazed with boredom before perking up, looking around for the source of that tell-tale sign of a post-slosh belly. She moves her hips subtly into any position as she looks around, any position rather than upwards, focusing more on her curiosity more than attentiveness to the sermon. Her eyes now sharply scanning though the crowd like a hawk as she observes other churchgoers as she tries to figure out who the lucky woman is."

    Yul "(Where did the sound come from… I know I did hear it…)"

    "As she scans the crowd more quickly, the feeling of her hallucinating things began to fill her mind as it felt like maybe she just heard someone growling for a large meal. That is until she noticed a young nun with a particularly odd figure that she didn’t think a nun would have while serving the church… massive breasts as her loose, brown nun robes mask another bump underneath it. A belly hidden under the veil of her service clothes, let alone her well-endowed chest that left to the young woman’s imagination to fill in the blanks of what just happened, especially since she looks as young as her. She is visibly massaging her stomach quietly as a soft blush emerges on her face while she looks at the priest with devout devotion demanded from her in spite of her less than ideal state."

    Yul "(W-Wait did she actually, there’s no way I am seeing this right, her of all people?)"

    "A small bit of curiosity begins to fill her mind as she stares at the nun with the out-of-place belly. Her stomach appearing round underneath the robes but clearly taut in its state, at a size that is unmistakable but subtle enough to be missed if not looking carefully in the pews. The visual only being validated when the young girl began to hear the very faint sounds of the happy organs working hard under the robes and reaching her ear. Or was she imagining that she heard it, it's a sound that has become very familiar to her after a few acts like that herself, ideas and desires filling in the slow pace the sermon was to her. Can’t really blame a girl whose live seemingly was filled with action or interesting stuff at least once a week and who is capable of going just about anywhere and doing anything she wants."

    Yul "(But a nun? Why would a nun lick another of all people, shouldn’t she abide to the teachings and refrain from it? What pushed her to resort to the act or indulge in it? Was it a someone whose conscious couldn- no that wouldn’t make sense, they’d be sent to an asylum with the other minnows if someone like that showed to a church of all places. Maybe it was a friend, a fun act gone to far in their moment of pri- wait… no a nun wouldn’t do that either. Maybe she was forced to do it, why though? Was it money, danger, someone threatening her sisters? Then that would make sense… though she seems to be happy about it. Maybe she enjoys it… heh… hehehehehe… I wonder who’s the lucky boy or girl adding to her. Maybe she saw a moment and seized it, someone too juicy, too pretty, sinful even to just let go?~ No nonono Yuliana, snap out of it, she’s a servant of God. She can’t possibly be doing something that would be so sinful unless… hehehe… wait no, wouldn’t she be booted from the church for it. If so why is she still here? Sitting so happy, satisfied in spite of it all, what perfect act did she do to pull it off, to have such a chest… mmmmm… such a nice chest to add to, she probably has a lovely body too, I wouldn’t blame anyone wanting to add to it… SHIT, Yuli get a hold of yourself, it’s a NUN, you’re in CHURCH, and yet she’s here with a gut and a smile… listening to the sermon. I should try to at least be like her. Uggggh, I really need to get a hold of my appetite, if only that distraction wasn’t there, such a delectable conflict of interest out there in sight of the whole world. I should really be thinking about what to do after this than dwelling on something so sinfu-)"

    "A brief moment of silence fills the room as she realizes that the nun is looking at her in the eyes. The young woman darts her eyes away from her gaze as she sits up straight and presses her yellow-clad back on the pew as she stares towards the altar, the father clearly walking back towards it with graceful, careful steps towards the green-colored table that she grew all too familiar with. The church filled with silence as the next part of the service is being set up before the lord, a lil prelude before the lord’s prayer begins and everyone prays it in unison. A filling silence that all seem to adhere to outside of the faint singing of birds outside, as if the world itself appeared to respect it in the moment…"

    Yul "(How much, no how long has she been staring at me? Does she know I know? What is running through her mind? Sheesh I need to be polite, less nosy Yuli… sheesh… Though… do I lo- YULI- Dang it)"

    "The silence continues as she sits up straight and looks at the priest begin to sit down on the chair before the altar briefly. It’s almost time for the prayer, just a little bit longer until everything is all over and everyone moves on with their days, celebrating the rest of their day, having lunch and dinner, homework, preparing for work, or anything Catholics would do. Though, after a few moments, the young girl begins to realize that her cheeks feels a little warm before coming to the realization that her face is warm. Hopefully not flustered but it certainly feels like that for a moment before the sound of everyone standing up fills the room in unison with the father. A moment of embarrassment gone through the motions of service."

    "“Let us stand for the lord’s prayer…”, the father’s voice bellows into the congregation as everyone raises their arms, including the girl’s, her mother’s, the nun’s…"

    "“Our Father-“"

    "…"

    "…"

    "…"

    "The music of the mass celebration sings hymns of praise as people of all walks of life begin to walk up the isle and towards the exit of the building as the young girl and her family walk with the tightly pressed crowd before leaving the church. Liberating themselves to a more spacious environment, the religious hymns become more distant and the environment outside the church becomes a little bit quieter." 
    
    Yul "She walks up to the father as the two smile to each other and the usual morning greeting is shared between the two, a simple “Good Morning and have a nice day father” before she went to the side and walk to the side and walking towards the side of a sidewalk where asphalt lays on what used to be a parking lot. She stares out towards the carless expanse, infrastructure that she imagined would have been entirely saturated with cars a century ago where car-dependent infrastructure was the norm, probably… would have cars filled a parking lot this large this early in the morning? Why was it built this way? Was cars better than existing transport, did it help prevent global warming for the strongest nation in history? The soft muffling at the back of her ears becomes louder and louder. A little over a century and the world changed. The voices get a bit more present in her mind as a familiar voice reaches out to her. A world of old, gone with the introduction of superpowers, a nation shattered on what to do, and a new society built from the ashes of old. A European sh-"

    "“Yuliana Santiago Gomez, world to Yuli?~”"

    "The familiar voice of her mother rings into her ears as Yuliana Gomez snaps out of her trance and sways around gently, arms swinging with her torso as she turns around and looks at her mother with a simile."

    Yul "“Mande Mama?”"

    "“I’ve been asking if you want to have breakfast with us Yuliana and you been staring out to the taco stand. Are you ok?”"

    Yul "“S-Sorry, just was thinking.”, She’d respond with a slight bit of embarrassment as she raises her right arm and rubs it at the back of her head."

    "“What are you thinking about?”"

    Yul "“Just… school. Just a lot on my mind, college and all. I’m gonna practice with my friends for the assessment exam later this week.”"

    "“Off playing with missiles in public property again? Don’t you know that’s illegal.”, her mother says with a bit of concern before sighing and admitting that her daughter is still going do it anyway, ”… Ok, just be safe and don’t get in trouble sweetie.”"

    Yul "“I will mami, I promise.”, she’d chirp back before walking towards her mother and hugging her, her fairly sizable bosom pressing against her chest as she gives her mother a loving hug before pulling back with a smile. She never got used to the size of mother’s bust after years of it gradually enlarging from her diet and incidents while she worked at her taco."

    "She begins to walk away, ambitious for the day ahead of her, the aroma of tacos filling her mind as her mouth waters. Breakfast on her mind as she walks towards a nearby alley some fair distance away but the thought of eating something sure is filling her mind. Though with a moment, she looks around and notices an odd sight, a lamia and another nun who looks young with a small ball of flames over her head, quite an odd combination as they head toward the church-held taco stand."

