label Day1_Acceptance_Letter:
    "Dear Yuliana Gomez,"

    "Congratulations, you have been accepted into Camifornia Polytechnic University of Pom under the College for Heroic Service for the fall semester. After a careful examination of your history, be believe you will do well in Cam Poly in our prestigious Heroics program. This year had been our most impacted year into this program to date with 10,000 applicants for a hero class of 200, so stand proud for you are part of the very best there is."

    "In Cam Poly, we put our heroic students through one of the most rigorous civil-hero programs of the country, rated #1 for the Better Heroes Bureau for their training and applications, crafting the finest heroes for a better tomorrow. In the program, you will partake in classes that increase your awareness, ingenuity, ruggedness, knowledge of regulations, urban combat training, close quarters training, consumption training and their alternatives, and even media literacy. Those who make it through their curriculum are destined for greatness such as “The Avatar of Fire”, “Portal Master”, “Raphael Gomez”, and even “Gabriella Jane”."

    "As a freshman in the Heroic Service Program, you will be housed on the east wing of our latest residential housing high-rise near most of your training areas so that you can exercise your abilities whenever you like. Though be cautious as you will be housed near those attending the College of Voracious Arts as the university cannot ensure the complete protection of those trying to consume others (in spite of enforcement), so stay sharp when going for training. "

    "The exact room assignment will come in the mail with this letter with early kickoffs starting August 2nd, be sure not to miss it! When you arrive to campus, be sure to drop off your belongings to the residential building’s front desk, then head to Building 5 and report to Miss Jane to get your schedule for the day of the tour. If you have any further question, we are happy to answer them, otherwise we all look forward to meeting you and seeing you shine."
    "Sincerely,"
    "Heather Hugo," 
    "College of Heroic Service President"
    "+1 (###) ###-####"

