label Day1_Cafe_Invite_Self_Gloria:
    "After thinking for a moment, Yuliana decides that it can’t hurt to go over and say hi and pass the time. What’s the worst thing that could happen?"

    "She pushes herself back and stands up from her chair as she picks up her backpack and places it on her seat and pushes it back in. She stretches for a moment before walking on over to the table the stranger is sitting at, her sneakers quietly and sneakily taking her over to the young woman. She does notice her approaching however just as Yuliana places her hand on a free seat sitting across from her."

    Yul "“Hello, is the seat taken?”, she quietly says, carefully awaiting for the stranger’s response."

    "“Sure, I don’t mind”, the young, soft woman responded to the interlocutor before her as she extended her hand out gently and amicably."

    "Yuliana smiles warmly as her self-invitation gets accepted. She pulls the chair out before her and quickly sits down, the cold of the seat eking out a shiver from her before getting comfortable. As she sits down and gazes into her, more about her becomes apparent as her dark green eyes shimmer against the latte-colored skin reflects her soft cheeks. She seems to be smiling back."

    Yul "“My name is Yuliana, and you?”, she’d open up as she extended her arm out in an attempt to be friendly."

    "She looks a little nervous to the opening interaction but quickly reciprocates after a moment to think about the action. She extends her right hand out and grasps Yuliana’s hand, shakes it and says “Gloria, nice to meet you.”, before returning to the comforting warmth of her drink, which becomes apparent to be hot chocolate through its rich aroma."

    Yul "“Pretty chilly out here today?”, she’d continue, seeing if she can strike up a friendly conversation with the woman before her for a little while before noticing the waiter walking over with another mug."

    "“Hot chocolate, sorry for the wait.”, the waiter said idly as he looked into Yuliana’s eyes and herself into his eyes as she got the impression of him wondering why she moved over but acting as professionally as possible. He places the cup of hot chocolate before her and powdered sugar in the middle of the table as he pauses for a moment to see if anything else is needed. Gloria’s gaze appearing to lighten as she sees that Yuliana too got hot chocolate and seeing someone else enjoying the sweet beverage."

    Yul "“Oh, I didn’t quite ask for your name since we’re going to the same college and all”, Yuliana would chirp back when she realized that she forgot to ask after the little act she did moments ago. She smiles and clasps her hands on her thighs as she acts a little embarrassed for her manners before him." 

    "“Kelvin, though you can call me Kalt”, Kalt responded as he smiled awkwardly back at her, before realizing the exact same thing, “And you?”"

    Yul "“Yuliana, nice to meet you Kalt”, she’d say kindly before looking back at Gloria whose gaze appears to be full of muted interest."

    "“Hmm? What college are you going to Yuliana?”, Gloria asked with a hint of interest in her voice as she leans in a little."

    Yul "“Cam Polytechnic State University”, Yuliana would reply before seeing Gloria appear to have a bit of excitement in her eyes as if something clicked in their mind."

    "“Really? Me too!”, she’d excitedly say as she enthusiastically looked at the two with glee, “What degree are you two pursuing?”"

    Yul "“Heroics”, She’d immediately respond before the waiter too responded with “Heroics” as well."

    "Gloria’s jaw drops in shock."

    "The three of them look at each other in complete amazement as they collectively realize that they’re all pursuing the same exact degree as the others, two of which know that they’re freshmen. The air goes silent (and cold) in excitement from the luck all of them are having by not only seeing fellow college students but peers in the same curriculum. Nobody says a word until Gloria finally breaks the silence." 

    "“No way! Me too, I recently got accepted into that program”, Gloria amazingly states as Yuliana and Kalt cannot help but be amazed at the sheer coincidence unfolding before them."

    "“No shot, what are the odds that all of us are not only attending the same college but also the same program as freshman!” Yuliana enthusiastically states as Kalt seemingly regains his composure from the surprising event before him."

